  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Solution": "Start with Inez's known age. Zack is \\(3\\) years older, so he is \\(15+3=18\\) years old. Jose is \\(4\\) years younger than Zack, so Jose is\n\\[\n18-4=\\boxed{14}\\text{ years old},\n\\]\nchoice \\(\\mathrm{C}\\).",
